WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.952
Everyday sign-in and signing out.

2
00:00:02.952 --> 00:00:08.979
Use your password and authenticator,
correct common mistakes, switch users,

3
00:00:08.979 --> 00:00:11.951
and return after a session ends.

4
00:00:13.545 --> 00:00:16.153
Enter your MERIT user name and password.

5
00:00:16.153 --> 00:00:20.977
Check the user name if you share a
workstation; each person uses their own

6
00:00:20.977 --> 00:00:21.977
account.

7
00:00:22.252 --> 00:00:26.081
A wrong user name or password
gives the same message.

8
00:00:26.081 --> 00:00:28.031
Check typing and Caps Lock.

9
00:00:28.031 --> 00:00:32.911
If you cannot remember the
password, use Forgot your password.

10
00:00:33.267 --> 00:00:36.171
Correct the password and choose Continue.

11
00:00:36.171 --> 00:00:39.996
A correct password takes you
to the verification step,

12
00:00:39.996 --> 00:00:42.097
not directly into MERIT.

13
00:00:42.458 --> 00:00:43.458
Wrong person?

14
00:00:43.458 --> 00:00:48.223
Choose Sign in as a different user
to return to the password screen,

15
00:00:48.223 --> 00:00:50.978
then start with the right account.

16
00:00:51.278 --> 00:00:52.289
Sign in again.

17
00:00:52.289 --> 00:00:58.212
Open the MERIT entry in your authenticator
app and use its current six-digit code.

18
00:00:58.212 --> 00:01:02.006
The app works without
receiving a text message.

19
00:01:02.373 --> 00:01:04.905
A mistyped or old code is rejected.

20
00:01:04.905 --> 00:01:10.619
Wait for the next code, check your phone
time, and use the entry for this MERIT

21
00:01:10.619 --> 00:01:11.659
account.

22
00:01:11.959 --> 00:01:15.773
Enter the current code and
choose Verify and sign in.

23
00:01:15.773 --> 00:01:21.427
MERIT returns you to the page you
requested, when your access permits it.

24
00:01:21.790 --> 00:01:24.772
Check your name and active
profile in the header.

25
00:01:24.772 --> 00:01:29.737
The profile determines which records
and tools are available after sign-in.

26
00:01:30.103 --> 00:01:34.600
Choose Sign out when you finish,
especially on a shared computer.

27
00:01:34.600 --> 00:01:38.875
MERIT returns to the sign-in
page and ends this session.

28
00:01:39.238 --> 00:01:44.213
If your session expires or an
administrator ends it, sign in again.

29
00:01:44.213 --> 00:01:48.102
You still need your
password and second factor.

30
00:01:51.260 --> 00:01:53.604
Use the normal two steps to return.

31
00:01:53.604 --> 00:01:57.152
If sign-in succeeds but you
lack the access you need,

32
00:01:57.152 --> 00:02:00.566
check your profile or
ask your administrator.

33
00:02:03.811 --> 00:02:08.324
In this video you corrected
password and verification mistakes,

34
00:02:08.324 --> 00:02:13.625
returned to the requested page with
two-factor sign-in, and signed out and

35
00:02:13.625 --> 00:02:16.245
returned after a session ended.
